of TikZ.

%package -n texlive-dyntree
Summary:        Construct Dynkin tree diagrams
Version:        svn67016
License:        LGPL-2.1-or-later
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
Provides:       texlive-dyntree-doc = %{epoch}:%{version}-%{release}
